      "en": "“But if a man is just, and does that which is lawful and right,",
      "ko": "사람이 만일 의로워서 법과 의를 따라 행하며",
      "source_text_hash": "60638214bcb336a313588da7f510d64eb810342bb778a189d4a30b53327177ba",
      "translation_text_hash": "7f39f176ad3388cd46dccfebcb0a072ced24bcf49e7a41f206259d3df13f60c4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "사람이 만일 의로워서 법과 의를 따라 행하며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "7f39f176ad3388cd46dccfebcb0a072ced24bcf49e7a41f206259d3df13f60c4"
      ]
    },
    {
