      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EZK",
          "chapter": 18,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "and has not wronged any, but has restored to the debtor his pledge, has taken nothing by robbery, has given his bread to the hungry, and has covered the naked with a garment;",
      "ko": "사람을 학대하지 아니하며 빚진 자의 전당물을 도로 주며 억탈하지 아니하며 주린 자에게 식물을 주며 벗은 자에게 옷을 입히며",
      "source_text_hash": "d2f07959903d05cbc30bb5fb297e5a3e8d3fc2e722590be7b0e5c513033ffee1",
      "translation_text_hash": "c72184ad5e652fb43efe03624e8a7241b98c47f726c3ffb18dc86bc12e0281e4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
