      ],
      "en": "who has withdrawn his hand from the poor, who hasn’t received interest or increase, has executed my ordinances, has walked in my statutes; he shall not die for the iniquity of his father. He shall surely live.",
      "ko": "손을 금하여 가난한 자를 압제하지 아니하며 변이나 이식을 취하지 아니하여 내 규례를 지키며 내 율례를 행할찐대 이 사람은 그 아비의 죄악으로 인하여 죽지 아니하고 정녕 살겠고",
      "source_text_hash": "bffc7b61585ddce318e80a3d50b60fcf48db7eded52956236c2811f12acb3289",
      "translation_text_hash": "146af1234d9b300cfde9c4d91aa2ed7ab22b9bd3420b0cf28b4d116945ad14b5",
